# The render pipeline's intermediate `helm template` output (D-28/D-29,
# Pattern 3: helm template | kustomize build). This is a transient
# artifact regenerated by every render — the only committed output of the
# pipeline is the final, kustomize-patched result under envs/<env>/, never
# this intermediate. Committing it would give ArgoCD (and reviewers) two
# competing sources of truth for the same rendered content.
overlays/*/rendered-input.yaml
